---
// /plenum/record — the complete record, verbatim (2026-08-02).
//
// This is what /plenum printed until today: PlenumPage → EnginePage, every sitting's full minutes
// and every graduated concept brief, nothing reordered and nothing shortened. It stayed on that
// exact component deliberately — the sitting anchors it assigns (`uniqueSessionAnchor`, walked in
// chronological order) are the addresses the dossier deep-links to, and re-rendering the record
// through anything else would have risked reassigning them silently. A test locks the two walks
// together (src/lib/plenum/dossier.test.ts).
import Page from '@/layouts/Page.astro'
import PlenumPage from '@/components/pages/PlenumPage.astro'
---
<Page
  title="The complete record — Line Check | Frank Bültge"
  description="Every sitting of the data-snack plenum and every graduated concept brief, verbatim and unshortened, as the collective wrote them. Unedited."
>
  <main id="main" class="flex-1">
  <PlenumPage />
  </main>
</Page>
